{"layout":"logicalStructure","root":{"data":{"text":"<p>渲染管线</p>","expand":true,"uid":"c89078f6-5506-4e8a-a045-53ee5cdc7494","richText":true,"isActive":false,"imgMap":{},"freeNodeTrees":[]},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>应用阶段</p>","uid":"fd854089-bb24-45bc-aa1b-1d2055958057","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"dir":"right"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>dcc工具或者unity等工具导出的数据</p>","uid":"e670460d-1c33-4a0b-accf-85e6d175e552","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>程序员可以进行各种处理，比如流势加载，裁剪，减面</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"926cf250-2e17-4fd1-8d63-453089497f58"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>几何处理阶段</p>","uid":"88da9f78-a00a-4b21-a5f8-5319186ea967","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"dir":"left"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>顶点做色</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"1b25cdf3-6a72-49fe-9e41-809b4da56f35"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>坐标</p>","uid":"b6ad33de-eb66-41d3-9de0-e361952d8fc8","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>模型变换：从模型空间转到世界坐标</p>","uid":"822a6e8c-452e-4a58-846d-8c818138be89","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>观察变换：把相机至于零点（换一个参考系，使后续的计算有一个统一，简单的基准）</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"08355e0d-66b5-42a8-b62f-f67f0dace991"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>左手：unity，directX</p>","uid":"7183cee7-dd27-45cc-a83e-23c96c8b31a0","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>右手：openGL, Vulkan</p>","uid":"6690b879-2740-45cd-82fb-c7f3897363b2","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>投影</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"49357b45-9552-480c-8cc0-42d422ef1e8f"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>NDC</p>","uid":"245b8c24-dc8e-451d-9fc2-344c8bda3911","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>近大远小</p>","uid":"25cf86b3-b3a0-4817-9b4d-03d165a7c5fb","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>裁剪简单</p>","uid":"ca220008-73fa-4af7-b772-7aa164004518","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>z-buffer 缓冲区</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"e782a742-cc48-4403-acdf-f7d8ef4ef02a"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>曲面细分</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"6cff183a-85be-4db4-9629-62857f050cd0"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>动态划分三角形?</p>","uid":"e643053d-8aaf-40e4-9ca1-e96c42c07f12","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>几何着色器</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"8d3fd2e5-a584-421e-a38c-ec956005cd6b"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>产生新顶点，生成粒子？</p>","uid":"4e2074ed-da98-490a-aa1f-1d3cbc5732ee","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>流输出</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"6747ad7d-f432-4381-af0e-6365d111618d"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p> 提供数据给其他系统使用？</p>","uid":"133c6c8c-386f-4a98-b1f2-5d361fc00223","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>裁剪</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"ada63076-8319-4c2a-8d49-0546d93ddb0e"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>只有NDC 内部区域会进行渲染，边缘会产生新的顶点</p>","uid":"76467737-8000-428b-87de-2bbb17a77ceb","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>屏幕映射</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"bb284371-e72a-4c12-a5e6-54e3f88424ee"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>平移+ 缩放得到屏幕坐标</p>","uid":"52e2881a-8f69-419a-be16-7a2b21c8219a","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>d=floor(c), d:像素索引,c:浮点数坐标</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"e0e003af-8233-42d5-88df-76eb6a180125"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>openGL: 笛卡尔坐标系。directX，vulkan:左上角为（0，0）</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"5984e48e-ab1e-4b23-b806-8e793f0d570f"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>光栅化阶段</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"a2f48d97-9d96-4774-8a97-23a507b9fc65"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>三角形设置</p>","uid":"0b038fb5-cad9-4632-8ccb-a369ff7562aa","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>微分方程</p>","uid":"f9decebe-e954-472b-a5d9-db21244dbc6e","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>TODO</p>","uid":"0ff3ae61-221a-4faf-aab5-e28f644fc6e1","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>边缘方程</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"55fc8e15-0af9-4585-858c-2bf86c5ffdeb"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>其他数据</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"8a608aa7-f1bc-4b26-90bd-409f0da83f7d"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>三角形遍历</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"7e355764-2cd5-4d43-b78e-ba9de5d5ecca"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>遍历所有的像素，根据顶点进行插值处理</p>","uid":"6974bc52-6a9b-4c51-b04e-5c87c5caad90","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>像素处理阶段</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"4cb2d9f0-2598-46c5-83a9-e6d4dba33f58"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>像素着色</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"1872c377-e02d-451c-b0ea-75c672da5465"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>逐像素进行处理，采样图片，等一系列操作</p>","uid":"1f69c54b-7e14-4055-8066-bc947476d7cb","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>合并</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"05d4795f-fe42-4453-b809-ce444761e1ca"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>ROP：渲染进颜色缓冲区</p>","uid":"3561592b-092d-4369-b059-6cd1355826be","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<